  "description": "“Wrongdoing… What did you do wrong?”    \n“It’s not ‘stop,’ but ‘do more,’ isn’t it?” \n\nAfter her cheating husband died with his mistress, Sunha pretended to go mad and seduced her father-in-law. Hyunseok, seeing through her act, tied his daughter-in-law's wrists with a necktie. The more she begged for forgiveness, the harsher his touch became. And the more she was punished, the more Sunha’s body crumbled.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14852187)",
